OL,5,G2355 Devil in Disguise: John Wayne Gacy
OL,6,     FTen Days (Pilot): After teenager,
OL,7,     FRobert Piest, disappears on his
OL,8,     Fmother's birthday, Des Plaines
OL,9,     FPolice Department officers track,
OL,10,     Finterrogate and tail the
OL,11,     Fcontractor Piest was last seen
OL,12,     Fwith.
OL,13,G0105 Playing Nice
OL,14,     FPete and Maddie find out that
OL,15,     Ftheir 3 year old son, Theo, was
OL,16,     Fswapped at birth with another boy.
OL,17,     FWill Theo's real parents want him
OL,18,     Fback? Or will the couples be able
OL,19,     Fto 'play nice'?
